  <Name>boykisser</Name>
  <Version>3</Version>
  <TotalPoints>3000</TotalPoints>
  <FactionKey>Stock/Alliance</FactionKey>
  <Description>Difficulty: &lt;color=green&gt;EASY&lt;/color&gt;
  Two VLS cells optimize launch delay, firing a salvo of cold launch torps then a salvo of hot launch torps and the the time it takes the colds to turn and ignite the hots come out the tubes alongside them
  </Description>
